{"3575920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Curse of Dominion", "steam_appid": 3575920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Command from Erindos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/c99557057a4f5ac70f3d5afe6eb34d43.poster.avif?t=1787232773\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/c99557057a4f5ac70f3d5afe6eb34d43.webm?t=1787232773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/c99557057a4f5ac70f3d5afe6eb34d43.mp4?t=1787232773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, you return to Erindos to train, upgrade, and refine your roster as you prepare for the next combat. Captains develop through a class system unlocked by levels and weapon mastery, while loyalty grows between allies who fight side-by-side, rewarding squads you build and keep together. Manage your resources and invest in what you control to sustain your advantage in your campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Master the Grid</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/2e8573b9dfebad7ad1475ef42c5719a6.poster.avif?t=1787232773\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/2e8573b9dfebad7ad1475ef42c5719a6.webm?t=1787232773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/2e8573b9dfebad7ad1475ef42c5719a6.mp4?t=1787232773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lead a roster of captains across a continental map, fighting grid-based battles where positioning, formation, and coordinated play decide the outcome. Each victory expands your territory, and each captured region strengthens your campaign through ongoing income.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Decisive Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/79e161b4714cb79a1e0ec18ff99ad6e1.poster.avif?t=1787232773\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/79e161b4714cb79a1e0ec18ff99ad6e1.webm?t=1787232773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/79e161b4714cb79a1e0ec18ff99ad6e1.mp4?t=1787232773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your tactical choices unfold as the perspective zooms in on the clash. Keep your captains ready, so every captured territory makes the next battle more winnable, and every battle makes the dominion harder to break.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Command from Erindos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/c99557057a4f5ac70f3d5afe6eb34d43.poster.avif?t=1787232773\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/c99557057a4f5ac70f3d5afe6eb34d43.webm?t=1787232773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/c99557057a4f5ac70f3d5afe6eb34d43.mp4?t=1787232773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, you return to Erindos to train, upgrade, and refine your roster as you prepare for the next combat. Captains develop through a class system unlocked by levels and weapon mastery, while loyalty grows between allies who fight side-by-side, rewarding squads you build and keep together. Manage your resources and invest in what you control to sustain your advantage in your campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Master the Grid</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/2e8573b9dfebad7ad1475ef42c5719a6.poster.avif?t=1787232773\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/2e8573b9dfebad7ad1475ef42c5719a6.webm?t=1787232773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/2e8573b9dfebad7ad1475ef42c5719a6.mp4?t=1787232773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lead a roster of captains across a continental map, fighting grid-based battles where positioning, formation, and coordinated play decide the outcome. Each victory expands your territory, and each captured region strengthens your campaign through ongoing income.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Decisive Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://